    <briefdescription>
<para>A clock implementation for Barycentric Dynamical Time (TDB). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classastrea_1_1astro_1_1Geocentric" kindref="compound">Geocentric</ref> Coordinate Time is a continuous time scale defined by the IAU. It is related to Terrestrial Time (TT) by a linear transformation that accounts for the relativistic effects of Earth&apos;s gravitational potential. TCG is commonly used in astrodynamics for high-precision timekeeping in the vicinity of Earth. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
